  "kernel_repo": "Aiden-HQ/AidenHQ",
  "notes": [
    "May add authority (grants, writes, roles or secrets) in: apps-platform, channel-telegram, chief-of-staff, ci, code-review, codehost-local, fleet-steward, github. Auto-updates accept it; turn them off to review first.",
    "Engine, model and effort combos per moment; Claude Code and Codegenie engines; per-run cost and findings",
    "Connect on first use",
    "Act on GitHub only as the owner; delete the GitHub App (#1065)",
    "Self-hosted by default with no setup, through a module door in every exposure",
    "The owner's MCP settings changes apply on his authority",
    "Brainstorm with forms, design review on Primer",
    "Approvals show what the AI reviewer is deciding, in green, not as waiting on you",
    "An approved PR's merge is filed for its task when its checks go green",
    "Owners move a release install to a verified main commit",
    "The welcome wizard ends with the commands to manage AidenHQ from your Claude",
    "An official release update is rejected only for exfiltration, new access or a bypassed hard gate",
    "Only an explicit go-ahead locks the Architect's design",
    "Architect live-test fixes (retry empty reply, reviewer reads short answers, review link)",
    "Accept post-merge proof from the completion comment",
    "No refused wake is dropped without a notice",
    "Every feature works without Tailscale",
    "A refused wake says why on its task, retries what can clear, and unpolled tasks get their own state",
    "Apply replaces every credential helper on the instance checkout",
    "The AI reviewer reads an agent's form and its options"
  ],
  "release": "2026.11.20.6"
}
